    /// - No state changes (SEG-1542).
    /// - Only persons whose subject records the caller may read are evaluated or counted (SEG-1542).
    /// - The predicate is refused as define-segment refuses it (SEG-003, SEG-004, SEG-005).
    ///
    /// Authorisation: public, scheme session, the tenant's policies decide. A principal whose policies permit the operation
    ///
