    /// Expire the credits of one bucket for a batch of accounts
    ///
    /// Postconditions:
    ///
    /// - At most one hundred accounts are handled, in one transaction (LDG-1547).
    /// - Each account with credit remaining in the bucket receives one entry of minus that amount with the key expiry:<bucket start>, so a repeated batch posts nothing twice (LDG-006, LDG-1547).
