    /// - When faults is set, the result reports what the deployment's own code did under them, counted from the trace of that run and from nothing else: the faults injected by kind, the processes stopped, the commit races retried, the replies lost and answered from their idempotency key, and the outbox publications offered, offered again and heard against the events committed.
    /// - The projection starts from the recorded history of the tenant at the revision the request names, or at the current revision when it names none: from the live state when that revision is the current one, otherwise from the journal replayed to it; the answer and the result state the revision it was computed at (AGT-422).
