    /// Preconditions:
    ///
    /// - The request carries the request token of the session (GWY-002).
    ///
    /// Postconditions:
    ///
    /// - The backend answers not found unless it was started for development (RUN-1386).
    /// - The build runs in the background, one at a time on the whole backend and at most one per verification interval for each tenant; its report arrives over the socket and is kept for the overview.
    /// - The build changes nothing of the tenant: a repeat runs the same check again, within the interval that limits it, so no idempotency key is taken.
